 Parts I, K, L — running

Part I is running on the corrected stratum under both budget conventions
(matched, and fixed-K). Results will be recorded here with their uncertainty;
with n = 7 the comparison is underpowered to rank arms against one another, and
Part A's H6 is the precedent for saying so rather than presenting a winner.
